{"version":1,"content":"<p>英國政府上周推出名為「準備好」（Be Ready）的宣傳運動，呼籲民眾儲備足夠維持3天的物資，以應對極端天氣或網絡攻擊等突發緊急狀况。</p><p>當地傳媒報道，罐頭食品、樽裝水、收音機及電筒等應急物資的銷量隨即急升。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T06:41:37.844577+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T06:08:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T07:38:17.448663+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T06:38:17.501585+00:00","content_hash":"a22da86fb9a200551c3b533c6653f0287036543edf602db5a5e23bb7cf1539ea","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}